Statistical Analysis of the Letters of Intent:
The Letters of Intent (LOIs) had the purpose to inform ESA preliminarily about:
• the topics the proposals would refer to;
• the number of research proposals to be expected;
• the number of Topical Team proposals to be expected;
• the number of involved scientific and industrial institutions;
• the names of the team members;
• the number of basic research and applications oriented proposals;
• the national distribution of participating institutions.
Since not all LOIs contained the requested information, they only allowed for a rough
statistical analysis, delivering the results the following tables summarise.
